      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今度はどんなメニューにしよう？\n力がつくように、お肉がいいかな～。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_f:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "咲さん、巻緒さん、お疲れさまです。\n真剣な様子ですが、何を話しているんですか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_f:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "お疲れさまです、●●●●プロデューサーさん。\n次の差し入れについて相談していました！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_f:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いよいよ本番だから、頑張れーって気持ちを\nい～っぱい込めたお弁当を作るんだ♪",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_f:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "体力をたくさん使うだろうし、\nご飯の量は、まだまだ増やしていいかもしれないね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_f:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうだね、お腹いっぱい食べてもらおう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_f:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そういえば……。\nもしかしてだけど、りゅうってイカが苦手なのかも？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_f:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうなの？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_f:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うん。この前のイカフライを見た時に、\nちょっと困った顔してたような気がして……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_f:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それなら、イカを抜いたメニューにしようか。\nあとはピーマンも、だったね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_f:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "毎回変わる差し入れのメニューは、こうした\n観察力やサービス力があって出来ていたんですね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_08_f:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "えへへ。もっともっと喜んでもらうぞーって\n思ったら、いくらでも頑張れちゃうんだよね♪",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
